---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Documentation | Unzip Files Online" 
  description="Technical documentation and guides for Unzip Files Online. Learn how to extract and create ZIP archives entirely within your browser."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 pb-24">

    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-body-sm font-mono text-mute mb-10">
      <span class="text-ink">Docs</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="space-y-5 mb-[100px]">
      <p class="text-mono-eyebrow font-mono text-ink uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">Documentation</p>
      <h1 class="text-heading-lg font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">Technical Guides & Reference</h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-body leading-relaxed">
        Learn how to maximize your workflow with our secure, local browser processing engine. Explore features, understand the interface, and discover best practices for file compression and extraction.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Guides List -->
    <div class="space-y-[48px]">
      
      <section class="border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">
          <a href="/docs/extract-zip" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-mute transition-colors">How to Extract ZIP Files</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body leading-relaxed">
          Comprehensive guide on securely unzipping files, previewing contents before extraction, handling password-protected archives, and selectively downloading specific data natively in your browser.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/docs/extract-zip" class="text-body-sm font-mono text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-mute transition-colors">Read Extraction Guide &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">
          <a href="/docs/create-zip" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-mute transition-colors">How to Create ZIP Files</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body leading-relaxed">
          Step-by-step documentation for generating ZIP files online. Covers drag-and-drop file selection, tuning compression levels, AES password encryption, and zero-knowledge privacy architecture.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/docs/create-zip" class="text-body-sm font-mono text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-mute transition-colors">Read Creation Guide &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer Navigation -->
    <footer class="mt-20">
      <p class="text-body-md text-mute">
        Need further assistance? Reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-mute transition-colors">Contact</a> page.
      </p>
    </footer>

  </article>
</Layout>
